,{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFormData"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFormErrorTypes"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"boolean"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tformdata","text":"TFormData","level":3},{"id":"tformerrortypes","text":"TFormErrorTypes","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"context","text":"context","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype ErrorVisibility<TFormData, TFormErrorTypes> = (context) => boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [validation.public.ts:227](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/validation.public.ts#L227)\n\nDecides whether a field exposes its validation errors publicly.\n\nFor fields inside a form group, scalar meta properties read from `state` are\nscoped to the containing group. `values` and `errors` remain\nform-wide.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFormData\n\n`TFormData`\n\n### TFormErrorTypes\n\n`TFormErrorTypes` *extends* [`FormErrorTypes`](../interfaces/FormErrorTypes.md)\n\n## Parameters\n\n### context\n\n[`ErrorVisibilityContext`](../interfaces/ErrorVisibilityContext.md)\\<`TFormData`, `TFormErrorTypes`\\>\n\n## Returns\n\n`boolean`\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: ErrorVisibility\ntitle: ErrorVisibility\n---\n\n```ts\ntype ErrorVisibility<TFormData, TFormErrorTypes> = (context) => boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [validation.public.ts:227](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/validation.public.ts#L227)\n\nDecides whether a field exposes its validation errors publicly.\n\nFor fields inside a form group, scalar meta properties read from `state` are\nscoped to the containing group. `values` and `errors` remain\nform-wide.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFormData\n\n`TFormData`\n\n### TFormErrorTypes\n\n`TFormErrorTypes` *extends* [`FormErrorTypes`](../interfaces/FormErrorTypes.md)\n\n## Parameters\n\n### context\n\n[`ErrorVisibilityContext`](../interfaces/ErrorVisibilityContext.md)\\<`TFormData`, `TFormErrorTypes`\\>\n\n## Returns\n\n`boolean`\n"}
